{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"17bdf25fc2bc474e172e908140f3347ee5752412ea0e3529f1c8472591416aea","occurred_at":"2026-11-12T06:40:54Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"mapped_intervals":[[63,83]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/repair_snapshot_vectors.py","quoted_text":"GIT_ROUTING_VARS = frozenset(\n    {\n        \"GIT_DIR\",\n        \"GIT_WORK_TREE\",\n        \"GIT_INDEX_FILE\",\n        \"GIT_OBJECT_DIRECTORY\",\n        \"GIT_ALTERNATE_OBJECT_DIRECTORIES\",\n        \"GIT_COMMON_DIR\",\n        \"GIT_NAMESPACE\",\n        \"GIT_CONFIG\",\n        \"GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL\",\n        \"GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM\",\n        \"GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM_NOSCOPE\",\n        \"GIT_CONFIG_COUNT\",\n        \"GIT_CONFIG_PARAMETERS\",\n        \"GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES\",\n        \"GIT_DISCOVERY_ACROSS_FILESYSTEM\",\n        \"GIT_PREFIX\",\n        \"GIT_QUARANTINE_PATH\",\n    }\n)","reason":"`_git_environment()` filters `GIT_ROUTING_VARS` but does not clear `GIT_TEMPLATE_DIR`, which `git init` honors. A caller-provided template containing hooks is copied into each temporary repository; a pre-commit hook can reject the oracle commits or have side effects. That breaks the script's intended hermetic fixture generation.","target":"2fb37625c2cff93cd34af884d32d9786e0ace94a"},"finding_id":"69ecb49aa9e1b566f39c66fa11f8eda84715fe69e66fc66c7df708e31b2a7119","previous_event_id":null,"review_id":"c7909c9a756f222292ef9ac1b7945d2a871c9d39f9b76a73b923cdbe9197cd2d"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:69ecb49aa9e1b566f39c66fa11f8eda84715fe69e66fc66c7df708e31b2a7119:31539387a7de446d611fb307c58b536732ba9bada1f9fc3c43ed437bf0af52b8"}